/home/joshu/Synthetic-Dream-Machine/bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/history/spirit-handback-custody-per-face.mem:673:| Opaque persona roster, active face, petnames, declarations, handles; add/remove face | Face founding/removal or operator selection; lifecycle and occasional selection | ''D'' labels, roots, declarations, private recognition; ''F'' minimal opaque routing index | Browser roster codec stores root indexes (`browser-custody.ts:313-325`); node rows (`vault-carriers.ts:301-314`); browser founding around `open-browser-vessel.ts:700-745`. Keep one Keyhive identity per PersonaGroup and none above them. Face existence/labels should not leak through a “minimal” index. |
