/home/joshu/Synthetic-Dream-Machine/bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/history/spirit-handback-custody-per-face.mem:679:| Face bundle cut, recovery, restore, pending restore commit | Person recovering/moving one face; occasional | ''D'' all face bundle and restore rows; ''F'' required public routing inputs; ''S'' only for truly common secret | Node selectors and bundle semantics (`vault-carriers.ts:230-231,392-397`); restore preflight/commit (`face-bundle-restore.ts:200-240,338-390`); mesh bundle law (`bags/lararium/ha.ka.ba/lararium/mesh/custody.mem:56,62,213-235`). Restore one face without opening another. |
