/home/joshu/Synthetic-Dream-Machine/bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/kapae.mem:126:A dyad's slot id hashes a veil key that never leaves its device, so the marker names the same relationship by the two ends every device of the fleet reads: the fleet root and the device key. A vouch names one voucher's stake. A member edge names the joiner's whole relation to the realm, whoever vouched: a marker over it holds against a fresh vouch from a hand that never saw the removal. A member who leaves by their own hand signs a departure and raises no kapae (<<~ loulou "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/stable-founding-road#/rulings">>).
