/home/joshu/Synthetic-Dream-Machine/bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/identity-enacts-relation.mem:44:''Operator ruling, 2026-10-19'', re-forming this meme's pattern after five custody research rounds (<<~ loulou "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/research/custody-per-face-2026">>). The living human stands as the singularity of #/head and the vault (<<~ loulou "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/persona-circle">> #/the-vault): no root, key or row names the person.
/home/joshu/Synthetic-Dream-Machine/bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/identity-enacts-relation.mem:49:A ''root'' is a secret one locus of custody mints and holds, whose loss or theft lands on that locus alone. Five kinds stand:
