/home/joshu/Synthetic-Dream-Machine/bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/pono/swarm-harvest/topic-a-pgp-web-of-trust-keyserver-collapse-47552e.mem:165:**Crypto custody rehearsal guidance:**
/home/joshu/Synthetic-Dream-Machine/bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/pono/swarm-harvest/topic-a-pgp-web-of-trust-keyserver-collapse-47552e.mem:166:- **Casa** is the only custody provider I found publishing an actual cadence: **semi-annual health checks**, with automated reminders — https://support.casa.io/knowledge/what-is-a-health-check, https://support.casa.io/knowledge/health-checks-in-the-casa-app, and specifically for inheritance recipients every six months, https://support.casa.io/knowledge/inheritance-recipient-health-checks. The stated threat model is the right one: **silent key failure**, where a device or backup degrades without the owner noticing. Confidence: **medium-high**.
/home/joshu/Synthetic-Dream-Machine/bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/pono/swarm-harvest/social-guardian-key-recovery-as-actually-pra-e9aa59.mem:129:- *LOW-MEDIUM, could not fetch primary:* The Defiant reportedly covered Ready shutting down its **card program on 2026-07-30** after issuer Kulipa wound down without warning (~1 hour notice; assets stayed in self-custody, subscriptions refunded). **Treat as unverified — a card-program shutdown, not a wallet shutdown.**
