/home/joshu/Synthetic-Dream-Machine/bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/pono/swarm-harvest/social-guardian-key-recovery-as-actually-pra-e9aa59.mem:192:**UNCHAINED** (unchained.com/about). *HIGH on what's published.* Headlines **"$0 Capital losses"**, **"₿100,000+"** secured, **"$1 Billion+"** loans originated — self-reported, no methodology. Collaborative custody 2-of-3; Caravan open-source multisig tool (https://www.unchained-capital.com/blog/the-caravan-arrives/, 2019). **No published data on how often clients lose keys or exercise recovery.**
/home/joshu/Synthetic-Dream-Machine/bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/pono/swarm-harvest/social-guardian-key-recovery-as-actually-pra-e9aa59.mem:200:**No one publishes a multisig-specific or collaborative-custody-specific failure rate.** Only aggregate "% of all BTC ever lost" estimates, which conflate death, forgotten passwords, discarded hardware, pre-2013 exchange failures and deliberate burns.
/home/joshu/Synthetic-Dream-Machine/bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/pono/swarm-harvest/social-guardian-key-recovery-as-actually-pra-e9aa59.mem:365:Separately, and **LOW-MEDIUM confidence** because I could not fetch the primary article: The Defiant reportedly covered Ready shutting down its **card program on 2026-07-30** after issuer Kulipa wound down without warning, with ~1 hour of user notice; wallet assets stayed in self-custody. Treat as unverified.
