/home/joshu/Synthetic-Dream-Machine/bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/pono/vessel-regions.mem:30:''The boot stands in two phases, and the plan reads on top of them.'' `standNodeFloor` claims the store before any Repo opens and returns a `NodeFloor`; the floor reads no private row. `SovereignReaders` gathers the boot's named private-row reads behind one seam (other private reads, such as the persona-root seed, keep their own custody paths): a composition handed readers stands sovereign, and a composition handed none stands at the floor and runs no reader. `packages/lararium-node/src/main.ts` stands the floor once and composes over it (`composeStanding` · `composeOrFloor` · `recompose`).
