/home/joshu/Synthetic-Dream-Machine/bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/pono/recovery-custody-scout.mem:17:role              = "recovery-custody-scout — VERBATIM handoff of the tasked spirit sent after the reconstruct-then-sign ⊥ threshold-attest fork. Carries the decisive comparative finding (every civic-scale m-of-n in the world is SECRET SHARING, never threshold signing), the availability inversion that makes Fork A's worst property its best one, nineteen measured ceremony failures, the distro-archive survey including a key actually lost, and a THIRD AXIS that dominates the one we asked about. Held as a collision surface, not a recommendation. Re-trued 2026-09-13 at #/our-own-ground ③: the third axis stands ANSWERED without delegation — identity-classes:520-529 rejects it for the persona plane and the contest window stands built and witnessed, so what stays terminal narrows to a LIVE capture of the op-key together with its next commitment, which falls to recovery-quorum."
