  ask, `lares meme` promotion) signs or opens by the EXPLICITLY SELECTED face's atom under its FCK. Several faces need a
  named face; ambiguity and no face refuse by name (the command names its face; I1's CLI takes `--face N`). Internal asks
  sort per call by the relation they protect; no shared S key.
